	(descr "Small decorative silkscreen mark: the official GitHub Invertocat logo (per github.com/logos brand-guideline social-button/secondary-placement allowance -- personal, non-commercial, not implying GitHub endorsement) plus the designer's own GitHub handle. Purely graphical -- no pads, no net, zero electrical/mechanical function/impact. Generated from the official GitHub-Mark PNG asset (github.githubassets.com) via Pillow (downsample+threshold to a 64x64 monochrome grid), rendered as run-length-merged fp_rect silkscreen fills; not a redraw/approximation of an unofficial third-party asset. Position chosen and DRC-verified clear of MH2, D2/D3, and the R-row at y=44.")
	(tags "logo decorative github attribution")
	(attr exclude_from_pos_files exclude_from_bom allow_missing_courtyard)
